+	depends on GPIOLIB && OF
+	help
+	  Drives a four-coil unipolar stepper motor from four GPIOs with an
+	  hrtimer, half- or full-stepped, with a speed ramp. Each motor is
+	  controlled through /sys/class/stepper/<label>/.
+
+config GPIO_IRCUT
+	tristate "Latching IR-cut filter on two GPIOs"
